Please don't put format related code in the map function. mapreduce has an input format argument and that's what you are supposed to use. By the way, I think the bug is also here because that unlist does not make sense to me.
Set input.format to make.input.format("csv", sep = ",") and v will be a data frame where you access columns like v[,1], v[,2] etc. I sincerely would like to have someone explain me why some users are not reading help(mapreduce). I would never ever try to use a function without reading the manual. I do not understand the thought process of people who do otherwise.

Antonio

